{"id":269673,"slug":"13bcd926855b0c8c095b692aa0ee0fec","name":"AV-ресивер Onkyo TX-NR6100","cat":"Ресиверы","cats":["AV ресиверы"],"price":97990,"old":null,"source":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/product/13bcd926855b0c8c095b692aa0ee0fec/","descriptionHtml":"</table>","shortHtml":"<p>7-канальный AV-ресивер, сертификация THX. Усилители с максимальной мощностью до 210 Вт по технологии Dynamic Audio Amplification. 6 HDMI-входов и два выхода, с поддержкой видео 8K, HDCP2.3, стандартов Dolby Vision и HDR10+, расширенного возвратного канала eARC. Система автокалибровки AccuEQ/AccuReflex. Сетевое подключение по Ethernet и Wi-Fi (2,4 / 5.0 ГГц). Поддержка технологий DTS Play-Fi, AirPlay2, Chromecast, Sonos, Roon. Поддержка аудио High resolution до 24 бит / 192 кГц (PCM) и DSD256. Двухсторонний Bluetooth. Габариты (ШхВхГ): 435x173x380 мм. Вес 9,8 кг.</p>","descriptionText":"","specs":[],"gallery":[{"src":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/onkyo_tx-nr6100-2.jpg","thumb":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/onkyo_tx-nr6100-2.jpg","alt":"onkyo_tx-nr6100-2.jpg","local":"assets/from-live/products/c56273ade6_onkyo_tx-nr6100-2.jpg"},{"src":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/onkyo_tx-nr6100-1.jpg","thumb":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/onkyo_tx-nr6100-1.jpg","alt":"onkyo_tx-nr6100-1.jpg","local":"assets/from-live/products/71b8ecfa7d_onkyo_tx-nr6100-1.jpg"},{"src":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/onkyo_tx-nr6100-3.jpg","thumb":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/onkyo_tx-nr6100-3.jpg","alt":"onkyo_tx-nr6100-3.jpg","local":"assets/from-live/products/bf60dccecb_onkyo_tx-nr6100-3.jpg"},{"src":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/onkyo_tx-nr6100_1694109727-4.jpg","thumb":"https://xn--80aannlcfckh.xn--p1ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/onkyo_tx-nr6100_1694109727-4.jpg","alt":"onkyo_tx-nr6100_1694109727-4.jpg","local":"assets/